{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_056_ddim-title\">DDIM</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">在相同 DDPM 训练边缘下采用隐式非 Markov、可确定性的跳步轨迹。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Constructs non-Markovian, deterministic reverse sampling trajectories that share the exact same marginal training distributions as DDPM.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">与 DDPM 相同目标训练的 epsilon 网络和初始噪声 xT</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Pretrained DDPM noise-prediction network ε_θ and initial Gaussian noise x_T</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">少步确定性或可控随机性的生成样本 x0_hat</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Sample x̂_0 generated in 10–50 deterministic (or tunable-stochasticity) subsequence steps</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.5</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=St1giarCHLP\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_056_ddim')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_056_ddim')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"DDIM original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/6339001402b3d8009b52.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.5</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_056_ddim', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_056_ddim\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_056_ddim')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_056_ddim', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_056_ddim\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">数据 x0</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x0</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">训练时的干净样本</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests pretrained ddpm noise-prediction network ε_θ and initial gaussian noise x_t and prepares initial tensor representations (x0).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"训练时的干净样本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests pretrained ddpm noise-prediction network ε_θ and initial gaussian noise x_t and prepares initial tensor representations (x0).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"数据 x0\" data-node-name-en=\"x0\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_056_ddim', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">数据 x0</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x0</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">训练时的干净样本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests pretrained ddpm noise-prediction network ε_θ and initial gaussian noise x_t and prepares initial tensor representations (x0).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"沿 DDPM 边缘分布 q(x_t|x0) 采样，不改变训练目标\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes training to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"训练加噪\" data-node-name-en=\"training\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_056_ddim', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">训练加噪</span><span class=\"lang-en\">training</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">沿 DDPM 边缘分布 q(x_t|x0) 采样，不改变训练目标</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes training to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"构造任意时间 t 的 x_t\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs noise epsilon within the core implicit deterministic diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"噪声 epsilon\" data-node-name-en=\"noise epsilon\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_056_ddim', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">噪声 epsilon</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise epsilon</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">构造任意时间 t 的 x_t</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs noise epsilon within the core implicit deterministic diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"复用 epsilon_theta(x_t,t)，可换算为 score\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs epsilon / score within the core implicit deterministic diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"epsilon / score\" data-node-name-en=\"epsilon / score\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_056_ddim', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>epsilon / score</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">复用 epsilon_theta(x_t,t)，可换算为 score</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs epsilon / score within the core implicit deterministic diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由 x_t 与 epsilon_theta 解析估计 x0_hat\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs x0 within the core implicit deterministic diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"x0 估计\" data-node-name-en=\"x0\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_056_ddim', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">x0 估计</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x0</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由 x_t 与 epsilon_theta 解析估计 x0_hat</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs x0 within the core implicit deterministic diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"跳步计算 x_{t'}；eta=0 时无额外随机噪声\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs DDIM update within the core implicit deterministic diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"DDIM 更新\" data-node-name-en=\"DDIM update\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_056_ddim', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">DDIM 更新</span><span class=\"lang-en\">DDIM update</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">跳步计算 x_{t'}；eta=0 时无额外随机噪声</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs DDIM update within the core implicit deterministic diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"保持训练边缘分布但重定义生成联合路径\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Markov within the core implicit deterministic diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"非 Markov 路径\" data-node-name-en=\"Markov\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_056_ddim', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">非 Markov 路径</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Markov</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">保持训练边缘分布但重定义生成联合路径</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Markov within the core implicit deterministic diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"确定性轨迹对应连续极限的概率流视角\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies ODE-like to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"ODE-like 极限\" data-node-name-en=\"ODE-like\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_056_ddim', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">ODE-like 极限</span><span class=\"lang-en\">ODE-like</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">确定性轨迹对应连续极限的概率流视角</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies ODE-like to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用选定时间子序列少步生成\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces sample x̂_0 generated in 10–50 deterministic (or tunable-stochasticity) subsequence steps via x0_hat.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"x0_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"x0_hat\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_056_ddim', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>x0_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用选定时间子序列少步生成</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces sample x̂_0 generated in 10–50 deterministic (or tunable-stochasticity) subsequence steps via x0_hat.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"DDIM Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 确定性 DDIM 跳步更新</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Deterministic Non-Markovian Subsequence Reverse Update Sharing DDPM Marginals</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"DDIM：核心公式 · 确定性 DDIM 跳步更新\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"56\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"24.772681pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.279199 -68.461197 290.669576 24.772681\" width=\"290.669576pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http: